Z||000005||StuGood||10-30-2000||11:55 PM||||Sheesh - if I ever learned to read, I'd be dangerous!  "Jeff - 85GT," I wonder whut that meeenz?.<P>Bill, my first reply <B>should</B> have been "<B>My</B> 1986 SE V6+ 4-speed's speedo gear is medium blue to dark blue."  Hope I haven't led you astray!<P>Maybe they use different gears for different final drive ratios, or maybe even for different tire sizes?  Not sure.<P>FWIW, one of my cheat sheets says all 1986 V6 Fieros with 4-speed (RPO M17) used a 3.65 final drive ratio.  Based on <B>that</B>, I tend to stick with my first reply. ||||reg||11
